{title: Sab Tera}
{artist: Armaan Malik Baaghi Amaal Malik}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Na jiya zindagi ek [Em] pal bhi
Tujhse [Am]hoke judaa sun [G]zara,        Bin [G]tere mujhse naraaz [Em]tha dil
Tu [Am]mila hai toh hai keh [D]raha,        Main toh tere [G]rang mein
Rang chuka hoon,        Bas [Em]tera ban chuka hoon
Mera [Am]mujhme kuch [D]nahi sab [C]tera,        Main toh tere [G]dhang mein
Dhal chuki hoon,        Bas [Em]teri ban chuki hoon
Mera [Am]mujhme kuch [D]nahi,        Sab [C]tera... [D]
Sab [G]tera,        Sab [Am]tera... [D]
Sab [C]tera,        [G] [Em] [Am] [G]
Phir [C]dil ke [G]raaston pe,        Teri [C]aahat jo [Em]hui
Har [C]dhadkan jashan [G]mein hai,        Yeh [Am]inaayat jo [D]hui
