Teri [C]aahat jo [Em]hui,        Har [C]dhadkan jashan [G]mein hai
Yeh [Am]inaayat jo [D]hui,        Main toh tujhe [G]milke jee uthi hoon
Teri [Em]dhadkan mein chhupi hoon,        Mera [Am]mujhme kuch [D]nahin
Sab [C]tera... [D],        Sab [G]tera
Sab [Am]tera... [D],        Sab [C]tera
Jis [C]pal tu saath [G]mere,        Uss [C]pal mein [Em]zindagi hai
Tujhe [C]paake paaya [G]sab kuch,        Koi [Am]khwahish ab [D]nahi hai
